{"blocks":[["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-1496","PHONES/MONITOR — one knob sets both the headphones and the MONITOR L/R outputs.",["XENYX 802S","Outputs and Monitoring"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-1586","STREAM TO MIX — puts the RCA stream input and USB audio into the main mix.",["XENYX 802S","Outputs and Monitoring"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-1671","STREAM TO MONITOR/PHONES — sends the same to the phones and monitor outputs only, keeping it out of the main mix.",["XENYX 802S","Outputs and Monitoring"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-1795","Meter — 4 segments.",["XENYX 802S","Outputs and Monitoring"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-1825","USB Audio Interface",["XENYX 802S"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-1851","USB/Connector/Ref/USB-B, class compliant with USB/UAC 2.0.",["XENYX 802S","USB Audio Interface"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-1922","2 in, 2 out at 48 kHz / 16-bit.",["XENYX 802S","USB Audio Interface"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-1958","The computer hears the main mix. Its playback comes back on ch 7/8.",["XENYX 802S","USB Audio Interface"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2030","Behringer describes no loopback or multitrack mode.",["XENYX 802S","USB Audio Interface"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2086","Connectors",["XENYX 802S"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2103","Audio/Connector/XLR — 2 × mic input.",["XENYX 802S","Connectors"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2151","Audio/Connector/Phone/TRS/6.35mm — 2 × mono line input, 3 × stereo input pair, MAIN L/R, MONITOR L/R and FX SEND (all impedance-Audio/Balanced), and PHONES.",["XENYX 802S","Connectors"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2324","Audio/Connector/RCA/Stereo — STREAM IN and STREAM OUT. STREAM OUT carries the main mix at a lower level.",["XENYX 802S","Connectors"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2439","USB/Connector/Ref/USB-B — audio interface.",["XENYX 802S","Connectors"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2492","DC power input and a power switch.",["XENYX 802S","Connectors"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2531","Electrical",["XENYX 802S"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2548","Line inputs — max +21 Audio/dBu. Mono: gain −10 to +40 dB, 22 kΩ balanced.",["XENYX 802S","Electrical"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2640","STREAM IN / OUT — max +10 dBu.",["XENYX 802S","Electrical"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2681","Main, monitor, FX outputs — 120 Ω, max +21 dBu.",["XENYX 802S","Electrical"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2740","Phones — +19 dBu into 150 Ω.",["XENYX 802S","Electrical"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2780","Main mix noise — −109 dBu A-weighted.",["XENYX 802S","Electrical"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2830","Power",["XENYX 802S"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2842","External adaptor, 100–240 V in, 18 V DC 1.0 A out.",["XENYX 802S","Power"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2899","12 W consumption.",["XENYX 802S","Power"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2921","Dimensions",["XENYX 802S"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2938","47 x 189 x 220 mm (1.9 x 7.4 x 8.7\"), 1.6 kg (3.5 lb).",["XENYX 802S","Dimensions"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-2997","In the Box",["XENYX 802S"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-3014","Mixer and power adaptor. Behringer lists nothing else.",["XENYX 802S","In the Box"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-3073","Compared",["XENYX 802S"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-3088","Behringer/Mixer/XENYX 502S — 5 inputs and one mic channel, with no phantom, no mid EQ band, no FX send and no MONITOR outputs. Its USB, preamp and output specs are the same.",["XENYX 802S","Compared"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-3276","XENYX 802 — the discontinued model without USB. It has a stereo aux return, control room outputs and RCA CD/Tape jacks where the 802S has STREAM jacks.",["XENYX 802S","Compared"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-3438","Source",["XENYX 802S"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-3451","Product page",["XENYX 802S","Source"]],["Behringer/Mixer/XENYX%20802S/","source-block-3518","Quick Start Guide, shared with the 502S",["XENYX 802S","Source"]],["Bellingcat/","source-block-0","bellingcat - the home of online investigations",[]],["Bellingcat/Investigation%20Toolkit/","source-block-20","About | Bellingcat's Online Investigation Toolkit",[]],["BenjiLifeOS/","source-block-21","Benji - The Life OS",[]],["BetterStack/","source-block-0","Better Stack - Observability Meets Incident Management",[]],["Bevy/","source-block-0","Bevy",[]],["Bevy/","source-block-27","Rust Video Game Engine",["Bevy"]],["Bevy/","source-block-61","Examples",["Bevy"]],["Bevy/","source-block-76","Game/Video/CLRS — minimal RTS / territory control game",["Bevy","Examples"]],["Bevy/","source-block-141","Game/Video/Gaia Maker - planet and terraforming simulation game",["Bevy","Examples"]],["Bevy/","source-block-213","Game/Video/Pico TD — pixel-art tower defense game",["Bevy","Examples"]],["Bevy/","source-block-273","Game/Video/Enty TD — mining tower defense game",["Bevy","Examples"]],["Bevy/","source-block-330","Top games for Web made with Bevy Engine - itch.io",["Bevy","Examples"]],["Bevy/","source-block-444","lots and lots of examples",["Bevy","Examples","Top games for Web made with Bevy Engine - itch.io"]],["BI/","source-block-106","Business Intelligence (BI)",[]],["BI/","source-block-137","The practice and tooling of turning an organization's data into reports and dashboards that people use to make decisions.",["Business Intelligence (BI)"]],["BI/","source-block-262","BI tools include Tableau and Sigma Computing.",["Business Intelligence (BI)"]],["Bibio/","source-block-92","Bibio",[]],["Bibio/","source-block-133","Recording identity of British producer, songwriter and multi-instrumentalist Person/Stephen Wilkinson.",["Bibio"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-366","Answers",[]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-406","Debut collaborative album by Bibio and Dorian Concept. Released on 16 October 2026; Bandcamp release and credits.",["Answers"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-575","Collaboration",["Answers"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-595","Built through experimentation and improvisation, combining traditional instruments with layered electronic textures. Warp describes the album as looking to the past to develop new music.",["Answers","Collaboration"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-786","The collaboration follows Bibio’s appearance on An Unopened Letter, the closing track of Dorian Concept/Music/Recording/Miniatures.",["Answers","Collaboration"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-928","The release page includes official videos for Womb Glow, Hammock Portal, Lichen Trip and Shame.",["Answers","Collaboration"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-1028","My Notes",["Answers"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-1051","Tracks",["Answers"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-1064","01 - Womb Glow",["Answers","Tracks"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-1083","02 - Lichen Trip",["Answers","Tracks"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-1104","03 - Shame",["Answers","Tracks"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-1119","04 - Pigeon Harp",["Answers","Tracks"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-1140","05 - Hammock Portal",["Answers","Tracks"]],["Bibio/Music/Recording/Answers/","source-block-1168","My Notes",["Answers","Tracks","05 - Hammock Portal"]],["Bibio/Music/Recordi